SUMMARY:IN THE SHADOW OF SILENCE. Book event at the Montclair Public Library
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a book talk with author Rae Dumont on her new novel “In the Shadow of Silence”. \nAbout the Book\nChild psychiatrist Eva believes her lonely childhood gifted her with the intuition to connect with even the most troubled. When she meets Lyman\, it seems that her dreams of having her own children are about to come true. They build a family. Their children grow up. But when Lyman abruptly stops therapy and medication\, he spirals into a dark\, irritable isolation that results in his suicide\, leaving Eva to rebuild after his loss shatters her life. \nReviews\nEditor’s Pick: https://booklife.com/booklife-review/9798896360728\nReaders Favorites: https://readersfavorite.com/book-review/in-the-shadow-of-silence\nKirkus: https://www.kirkusreviews.com/book-reviews/rae-dumont/in-the-shadow-of-silence.\nP.English Review: Blog: https://peterokonkwoliterature.wordpress.com/2026/03/17/in-the-shadow-of-silence-a-novel-by-rae-dumont/ \nAbout the Author\nRaymonde Dumont\, MD\, LMFT\, is both a pediatrician and a family therapist. Her early work focused on the impact of one person’s illness through their entire family\, and also on the impact of mental health and family function on medical outcomes. \nShe is currently a family therapist in private practice inMontclair. She helps families to navigate difficulties by collaborating\, rather than becoming divided. She is also a mother\, a widow\, and a friend to many.\n\n\n\nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/in-the-shadow-of-silence-book-event-at-the-montclair-public-library/
LOCATION:The Montclair Public Library\, 50 S Fullerton Ave\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Literature
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2026_03_25_12_01_15.png
END:VEVENT
