SUMMARY:CreativeMornings: Community Takes the Stage
DESCRIPTION:CreativeMornings is a free monthly breakfast lecture series for anyone who identifies as creative (yes\, that means you!). With 250+ chapters in 70 countries\, we’re thrilled to host the first & only NJ chapter in Montclair! \nThis month\, our global theme is “Create” and our speaker is our community! That’s right\, we’re passing the mic to you. \nWe’re opening up the stage for 8 community members to share what that means to them. Music\, spoken word\, storytelling\, show and tell\, something a little weird\, something deeply personal- we’re into all of it. You’ll have 5 minutes and a room full of supportive\, kind people who can’t wait to listen. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
