SUMMARY:MARAC Innovative Archives Award Presentation at Montclair History Center
DESCRIPTION:The Montclair History Center has been awarded the 2026 Innovative Archives Award by the Mid-Atlantic Regional Archives Conference (MARAC) New Jersey Caucus in recognition of its leadership in preserving and sharing local history. The award highlights the organization’s commitment to inclusive storytelling\, strong community partnerships and collaborations\, oral history initiatives\, and expanding free public access to MHC’s collections. MARAC’s selection committee congratulates Executive Director Angelica Diggs\, Collections Manager Erin Benz\, and the Board of Trustees for their dedication to preserving and sharing Montclair’s diverse history. \nJoin MARAC and the Montclair History Center for an award presentation and gathering at the Crane House & Historic YWCA at 11 am. \nMuseum tours will be offered following the presentation celebrating preservation month and highlighting items from the collections and archives. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/marac-innovative-archives-award-presentation-at-montclair-history-center/
LOCATION:Crane House & Historic YWCA\, 110 Orange Road\, Montclair\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
