SUMMARY:Lenape Movie Day
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to join us for an afternoon of film\, food\, and discussion! Lenape Movie Day is going to be held on May 17th at 1pm and is going to feature the documentary Mann v. Ford (2010). This film details a class-action lawsuit filed by the Ramapough Mountain Indians in New Jersey against the Ford Motor Company. It covers the community’s five-year legal battle against Ford and the EPA regarding the dumping of thousands of tons of toxic paint sludge\, which caused severe illnesses\, cancer\, and environmental devastation. We’ll have a potluck lunch before the screening\, and a discussion with one of the film’s producers afterwards! We hope to see you there! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
