SUMMARY:S.O.F.I.A.’s Comedy & Karaoke Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to an afternoon of laughter\, music\, and community spirit at S.O.F.I.A.’s upcoming Comedy & Karaoke Fundraiser!\nAll proceeds will support S.O.F.I.A.’s “Fresh Start Program\,” which provides essential housewares and furniture for clients transitioning into their new homes after leaving safe housing. \nEvent Details:\nDate: Sunday\, May 17\, 2026\nTime: 2:00 PM – 5:00 PM\nLocation: Just Jakes\, 30 Park Street\, Montclair\, NJ\nDonation: $25 \nThis exciting event will be hosted by DJ Corey Anderson and will feature comedy by Montclair’s own Glen “Rated G” Sellers\, along with karaoke performances from local community leaders and special guests\, including: \n*Madeline Gale & Reubena Spencer (Out Montclair)\n*Mayor Renee Baskerville and company\n*The Men of Eureka Lodge #52 & Golconda Temple #24\n*Maddie and Garth Guthrie (Reaching Out Montclair\n*Joe and Donna Davis (Brother to Brother).\nYour presence and support help us continue making a meaningful impact in the lives of survivors and families in our community.\nFor more information or to make a contribution\, please visit SupportSOFIA.org/donate or contact us at (862) 251-6791.\nWe hope to see you there for an afternoon filled with fun\, laughter\, and purpose! \nPlease share this with your network. To reserve your seat please donate $25 at supportsofia.org/donate \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
